  "description": "The LED daytime running lights are not only used as a sleek DRL but also function as sequential switchback turn signals to keep others informed of your intentions when you change lanes or make a turn.\nFitment\n2009-2014 Ford F150\nNot suitable for vehicles with an electric adjustment function\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nBi-functional LED bar: not only used as a sleek LED daytime running lamp to raise the visibility and complete the car's look, but functions as sequential turn signal to keep others informed of your intentions when you change lane or make a turn\nWaterproof: fully sealed with solid silicon & designed with one-way vents to prevent moisture from being trapped inside the housing, no corrosion or moisture worries in sorts of weather conditions such as rain, snow or dust storms\nBrighter & safer: the metallic parabolic reflectors provide more light output to create a broader and smoother beam, ensuring your driving safety and others'\nImpact resistance, sharper lighting: the polycarbonate lens & tough housing are highly resistant to shock, vibration for any tough road; the durable lens is also impervious to fogging, discoloring and scratch for an enhanced driving experience\nSafety reflector: the sided micro-prism reflector makes the oncoming cars or passerby quickly notice you at night, ensuring your driving safety and others'; professional installation would be highly recommended",
